{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 2,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 539.148,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the commencement of the fifth year of their reign",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.778,
      "end": 7.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there began to be a contention among the people;",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.023,
      "end": 10.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a certain man, being called Amlici,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.989,
      "end": 12.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being a very cunning man,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.027,
      "end": 16.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a wise man as to the wisdom of the world,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.318,
      "end": 20.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being after the order of the man that slew Gideon by the sword,",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.91,
      "end": 23.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was executed according to the law\u2014",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.144,
      "end": 28.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this Amlici had, by his cunning, drawn away much people after him;",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.875,
      "end": 32.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so much that they began to be very powerful;",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.306,
      "end": 37.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to endeavor to establish Amlici to be a king over the people.",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.466,
      "end": 41.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was alarming to the people of the church,",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.804,
      "end": 46.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also to all those who had not been drawn away after the persuasions of Amlici;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.092,
      "end": 49.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they knew that according to their law",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 49.362,
      "end": 53.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that such things must be established by the voice of the people.",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.989,
      "end": 58.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, if it were possible that Amlici should gain the voice of the people,",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 58.349,
      "end": 64.711,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he, being a wicked man, would deprive them of their rights and privileges of the church;",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 64.891,
      "end": 68.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was his intent to destroy the church of God.",
      "verse": "2:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 68.775,
      "end": 74.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people assembled themselves together throughout all the land,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 74.481,
      "end": 76.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to his mind,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 76.89,
      "end": 79.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether it were for or against Amlici,",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.949,
      "end": 84.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in separate bodies, having much dispute and wonderful contentions one with another.",
      "verse": "2:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 85.598,
      "end": 91.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they did assemble themselves together to cast in their voices concerning the matter;",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 91.397,
      "end": 93.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were laid before the judges.",
      "verse": "2:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 94.213,
      "end": 99.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the voice of the people came against Amlici,",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 99.687,
      "end": 102.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he was not made king over the people.",
      "verse": "2:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 102.875,
      "end": 107.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this did cause much joy in the hearts of those who were against him;",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 107.188,
      "end": 110.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but Amlici did stir up those who were in his favor",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 110.619,
      "end": 113.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to anger against those who were not in his favor.",
      "verse": "2:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 114.55,
      "end": 118.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they gathered themselves together,",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 118.863,
      "end": 121.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did consecrate Amlici to be their king.",
      "verse": "2:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 122.144,
      "end": 124.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Amlici was made king over them",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 124.785,
      "end": 129.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he commanded them that they should take up arms against their brethren;",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 129.47,
      "end": 130.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this he did",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 131.043,
      "end": 133.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might subject them to him.",
      "verse": "2:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 133.859,
      "end": 139.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the people of Amlici were distinguished by the name of Amlici, being called Amlicites;",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 139.89,
      "end": 142.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the remainder were called Nephites,",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 142.578,
      "end": 144.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the people of God.",
      "verse": "2:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 144.744,
      "end": 150.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore the people of the Nephites were aware of the intent of the Amlicites,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 150.357,
      "end": 152.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and therefore they did prepare to meet them;",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 152.952,
      "end": 156.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they did arm themselves with swords, and with cimeters,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 156.754,
      "end": 159.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with bows, and with arrows,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 159.21,
      "end": 161.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with stones, and with slings,",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 161.666,
      "end": 164.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with all manner of weapons of war, of every kind.",
      "verse": "2:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 165.457,
      "end": 169.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they were prepared to meet the Amlicites at the time of their coming.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 169.724,
      "end": 176.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there were appointed captains, and higher captains, and chief captains, according to their numbers.",
      "verse": "2:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 177.138,
      "end": 183.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amlici did arm his men with all manner of weapons of war of every kind;",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 183.355,
      "end": 189.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also appointed rulers and leaders over his people, to lead them to war against their brethren.",
      "verse": "2:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 190.119,
      "end": 195.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Amlicites came upon the hill Amnihu,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 195.222,
      "end": 197.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was east of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 197.956,
      "end": 200.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ran by the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 200.597,
      "end": 203.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there they began to make war with the Nephites.",
      "verse": "2:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 203.971,
      "end": 208.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Alma, being the chief judge and the governor of the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 208.702,
      "end": 211.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he went up with his people,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 211.39,
      "end": 214.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, with his captains, and chief captains,",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 214.403,
      "end": 218.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, at the head of his armies, against the Amlicites to battle.",
      "verse": "2:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 219.355,
      "end": 223.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to slay the Amlicites upon the hill east of Sidon.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 224.04,
      "end": 228.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Amlicites did contend with the Nephites with great strength,",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 228.4,
      "end": 232.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that many of the Nephites did fall before the Amlicites.",
      "verse": "2:17",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 233.26,
      "end": 237.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless the Lord did strengthen the hand of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 237.295,
      "end": 240.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they slew the Amlicites with great slaughter,",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 240.494,
      "end": 242.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they began to flee before them.",
      "verse": "2:18",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 243.403,
      "end": 248.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Nephites did pursue the Amlicites all that day,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 248.227,
      "end": 250.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did slay them with much slaughter,",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 250.915,
      "end": 253.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that there were slain of the Amlicites",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 254.16,
      "end": 257.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "twelve thousand five hundred thirty and two souls;",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 257.451,
      "end": 260.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there were slain of the Nephites",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 260.742,
      "end": 263.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "six thousand five hundred sixty and two souls.",
      "verse": "2:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 264.673,
      "end": 268.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Alma could pursue the Amlicites no longer",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 269.172,
      "end": 273.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he caused that his people should pitch their tents in the valley of Gideon,",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 273.857,
      "end": 279.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the valley being called after that Gideon who was slain by the hand of Nehor with the sword;",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 280.028,
      "end": 283.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in this valley the Nephites did pitch their tents for the night.",
      "verse": "2:20",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 284.377,
      "end": 288.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma sent spies to follow the remnant of the Amlicites,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 288.272,
      "end": 291.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might know of their plans and their plots,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 291.61,
      "end": 294.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whereby he might guard himself against them,",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 294.809,
      "end": 297.781,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might preserve his people from being destroyed.",
      "verse": "2:21",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 298.461,
      "end": 302.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now those whom he had sent out to watch the camp of the Amlicites",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 302.728,
      "end": 306.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were called Zeram, and Amnor, and Manti, and Limher;",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 306.855,
      "end": 311.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "these were they who went out with their men to watch the camp of the Amlicites.",
      "verse": "2:22",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 312.086,
      "end": 319.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that on the morrow they returned into the camp of the Nephites in great haste, being greatly astonished,",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 319.464,
      "end": 321.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and struck with much fear, saying:",
      "verse": "2:23",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 322.42,
      "end": 325.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we followed the camp of the Amlicites,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 325.851,
      "end": 331.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to our great astonishment, in the land of Minon, above the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 331.279,
      "end": 333.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the course of the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 334.013,
      "end": 336.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we saw a numerous host of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 336.747,
      "end": 339.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, the Amlicites have joined them;",
      "verse": "2:24",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 340.167,
      "end": 343.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they are upon our brethren in that land;",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 343.876,
      "end": 350.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are fleeing before them with their flocks, and their wives, and their children, towards our city;",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 350.976,
      "end": 352.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and except we make haste",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 352.921,
      "end": 355.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they obtain possession of our city,",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 355.469,
      "end": 358.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our fathers, and our wives, and our children be slain.",
      "verse": "2:25",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 359.446,
      "end": 363.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people of Nephi took their tents,",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 363.713,
      "end": 366.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and departed out of the valley of Gideon",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 366.633,
      "end": 370.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "towards their city, which was the city of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "2:26",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 371.075,
      "end": 374.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, as they were crossing the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 374.784,
      "end": 380.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites and the Amlicites, being as numerous almost, as it were,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 380.583,
      "end": 382.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as the sands of the sea,",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 382.528,
      "end": 384.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "came upon them to destroy them.",
      "verse": "2:27",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 385.669,
      "end": 391.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the Nephites being strengthened by the hand of the Lord, having prayed mightily to him",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 392.026,
      "end": 396.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would deliver them out of the hands of their enemies,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 396.571,
      "end": 398.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore the Lord did hear their cries,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 399.166,
      "end": 400.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did strengthen them,",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 401.018,
      "end": 404.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites and the Amlicites did fall before them.",
      "verse": "2:28",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 405.088,
      "end": 409.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma fought with Amlici with the sword, face to face;",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 409.912,
      "end": 413.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did contend mightily, one with another.",
      "verse": "2:29",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 414.029,
      "end": 419.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma, being a man of God, being exercised with much faith,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 419.41,
      "end": 423.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cried, saying: O Lord, have mercy and spare my life,",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 423.305,
      "end": 427.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may be an instrument in thy hands to save and preserve this people.",
      "verse": "2:30",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 428.304,
      "end": 430.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Alma had said these words",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 430.806,
      "end": 433.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he contended again with Amlici;",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 433.354,
      "end": 437.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was strengthened, insomuch that he slew Amlici with the sword.",
      "verse": "2:31",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 438.306,
      "end": 441.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also contended with the king of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 441.69,
      "end": 445.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the king of the Lamanites fled back from before Alma",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 445.678,
      "end": 447.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sent his guards to contend with Alma.",
      "verse": "2:32",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 448.634,
      "end": 455.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Alma, with his guards, contended with the guards of the king of the Lamanites until he slew and drove them back.",
      "verse": "2:33",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 456.001,
      "end": 459.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he cleared the ground, or rather the bank,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 459.478,
      "end": 462.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was on the west of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 462.212,
      "end": 466.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "throwing the bodies of the Lamanites who had been slain into the waters of Sidon,",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 466.757,
      "end": 469.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby his people might have room to cross",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 470.141,
      "end": 476.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and contend with the Lamanites and the Amlicites on the west side of the river Sidon.",
      "verse": "2:34",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 476.719,
      "end": 481.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when they had all crossed the river Sidon",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 481.775,
      "end": 485.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lamanites and the Amlicites began to flee before them,",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 485.949,
      "end": 489.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding they were so numerous that they could not be numbered.",
      "verse": "2:35",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 490.576,
      "end": 492.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they fled before the Nephites",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 492.892,
      "end": 496.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "towards the wilderness which was west and north,",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 496.23,
      "end": 498.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "away beyond the borders of the land;",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 498.918,
      "end": 502.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Nephites did pursue them with their might,",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 502.209,
      "end": 503.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did slay them.",
      "verse": "2:36",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 504.561,
      "end": 506.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they were met on every hand,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 507.156,
      "end": 508.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slain",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 508.543,
      "end": 509.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and driven,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 509.791,
      "end": 512.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they were scattered on the west,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 512.525,
      "end": 514.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on the north,",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 514.284,
      "end": 518.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had reached the wilderness, which was called Hermounts;",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 518.597,
      "end": 523.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was that part of the wilderness which was infested by wild and ravenous beasts.",
      "verse": "2:37",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 524.664,
      "end": 529.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that many died in the wilderness of their wounds,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 529.534,
      "end": 533.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were devoured by those beasts and also the vultures of the air;",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 533.894,
      "end": 535.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their bones have been found,",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 535.839,
      "end": 538.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have been heaped up on the earth.",
      "verse": "2:38",
      "lineIndex": 142
    }
  ]
}